# Runtime database.
# NEVER commit this: it contains Argon2 password hashes and payment tokens.
# A database with credentials in git history is CWE-540 and is one of the first
# things a Phase III analyst will grep for.
casino.db
casino.db-wal
casino.db-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

